# Environment files
# NOTE: root .env is intentionally TRACKED — it holds only public VITE_
# vars (baked into the JS bundle by Vite anyway) so Vercel builds from
# `main` work without dashboard setup. NEVER commit server/.env
# (service_role / API secrets).
server/.env